      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 3.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "right, evening. Let's get started"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "I mean, you know, hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.1,
      "end_seconds": 19.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.33,
      "end_seconds": 25.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "well I've been having a sore ankle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.27,
      "end_seconds": 29.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.35,
      "end_seconds": 45.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "nearly done with the the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.81,
      "end_seconds": 67.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 125 over 68 pulse is 64 beats a minute SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.35,
      "end_seconds": 69.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.73,
      "end_seconds": 78.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon what's the timeline, when did it it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.58,
      "end_seconds": 89.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "about... well about a month. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.98,
      "end_seconds": 95.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Right would you say mild moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.89,
      "end_seconds": 104.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "pretty moderate if I'm being honest. A little swelling was there but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.87,
      "end_seconds": 111.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Any pain in the foot, numbness or crack or pop?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.32,
      "end_seconds": 118.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "no, no pain in the foot, numbness or crack or pop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.08,
      "end_seconds": 122.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.78,
      "end_seconds": 129.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Well, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.69,
      "end_seconds": 146.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.58,
      "end_seconds": 155.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Ah, I take Foracort inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.5,
      "end_seconds": 159.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.74,
      "end_seconds": 165.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "for about three months. Escitalopram 10 milligrams once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.79,
      "end_seconds": 169.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.23,
      "end_seconds": 171.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "no, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.38,
      "end_seconds": 180.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies. Bear with me I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.35,
      "end_seconds": 185.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Well, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.69,
      "end_seconds": 189.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Alright, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.5,
      "end_seconds": 194.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.78,
      "end_seconds": 197.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.3,
      "end_seconds": 201.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.27,
      "end_seconds": 220.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.14,
      "end_seconds": 223.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.23,
      "end_seconds": 227.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.64,
      "end_seconds": 241.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.27,
      "text": "I have asthma. Okay, so I have depression. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I've been reading about it online and it worried me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.46,
      "end_seconds": 245.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Alright asthma that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.84,
      "end_seconds": 251.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Let's move on to to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.84,
      "end_seconds": 254.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "breathe out slowly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.85,
      "end_seconds": 271.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "There's mild swelling over the outside of the ankle, and you can put your weight on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.82,
      "end_seconds": 277.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Good you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.78,
      "end_seconds": 304.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards a mild ankle sprain. It could also be a minor fracture, so we'll keep that open"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.37,
      "end_seconds": 309.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.28,
      "end_seconds": 329.28,
      "duration_seconds": 18.0,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a mild ankle sprain. Rest, ice, a compression bandage and keep it raised for two days. I'd like you back if it is not better in two weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.19,
      "end_seconds": 337.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.97,
      "end_seconds": 339.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
